            <ArticleTitle>Noninvasive vascular testing in occupational medicine.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>753-60</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Noninvasive vascular testing can provide early detection of peripheral vascular dysfunction. When it is used as part of a health screening program, the detection of disease can lead to early intervention, thus preventing disability and a decrease in the individual's productivity.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
